Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.65,0:00:10.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,2004年的夏普 MP-B300 · SigmaTel 主控 · DSP 内核 · 三洋收音芯片
No source. No docs. Vendor long gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.65,0:00:10.60,EN,,0,0,0,,A 2004 Sharp MP-B300. No source code, no docs, vendor gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.85,0:00:24.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,三个 AI 接力 · 26 个固件版本
全中文汉化完成 — 却在 90 MHz 撞上神秘的音量断崖
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.85,0:00:24.10,EN,,0,0,0,,3 AI agents. 26 firmware cycles. Full Chinese localization —
then a mysterious volume cliff at 90 MHz.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.35,0:00:34.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,从 SCSI 厂商命令到 DSP 指令级逆向，再到 PC 端 JIT 仿真
Every hypothesis tested on real hardware
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.35,0:00:34.48,EN,,0,0,0,,SCSI vendor commands → DSP-level reverse engineering → PC JIT emulation.
Every hypothesis tested on real hardware.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.73,0:00:45.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,6,763 字全量中文字库 · 零膨胀注入
Plus a zero-brick flash safety gate
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.73,0:00:45.06,EN,,0,0,0,,6,763-glyph Chinese font, zero-growth injection,
plus a zero-brick flash safety gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.31,0:00:56.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,方法论现已开源 · MIT
完整战役史与实名致谢都在仓库里
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.31,0:00:56.69,EN,,0,0,0,,The methodology is now open source. MIT licensed.
